# Heart of Fire - a themed island, ten times the size (x10)
# Inspiration: the island-goddess animated film (a stolen green heart, a burning mountain and its fire demon, the heart
#   carried home and the island turning green again) merged with volcano-adventure films (lava tubes, a black temple)
#   - the mood only, never named; the people and their customs are invented, no real culture is pictured.
# Island type: Shape 7 (Twin peaks), Style 4 (volcanic). Two great peaks: the Ember, a live volcano (south-west, 59 m),
#   and the Green Mother, a sleeping one (north-east, 63 m), a low pass between them; the burnt village on the broad
#   lowland of the north-west shore, the navigator's wreck in the bay off it.
# A navigator stole the Bloomstone, the Green Mother's heart, from her summit shrine. The Ember woke, the island burned to
# ash and the Cinderwraith - a great bird of black stone and fire - rose out of its crater. The navigator's ship burned in
# the bay; the stone broke in three. The islanders took their canoes and left. Find the shards, mend the heart, carry it
# past the Cinderwraith to the Mother - and the island turns green (the ash layer hidden, the green one shown).
# Quest "The Bloomstone" (24 steps, 4 chapters): the ash shore (6), the three shards (8), the mending and the
# Cinderwraith (6), the bloom and the homecoming (4) - large and medium crop plot and canteen blueprints, seeds, titanium.
#
# Built by the recipe player (CIRecipe heart_of_fire) through the editor's own operations.
include lib_huts
include lib_sea
new
# (nature: volcanic - the generator's sparse scrub and trees, cut from the start; the ash and green layers the recipe's)
gen Trees=0.2 Bushes=0.3 Rocks=0.5 Harvest=0.25 BeachThings=0.3
gen Seed=9025 Radius=142 Height=70 Roughness=0.55 Peaks=2 Shape=7 Style=4 BeachWidth=0.4 Cliffs=0.45 PeakShape=0.6 Bays=0.3
gen Water=0.5 SeaRocks=0.25 SeaFinds=0.3 Sunken=0.4 Hostiles=0
generate

# --- Terrain: the wreck's hollow in the bay (9 m down); the lava tube's ledge on the Ember's south flank (16.5 m); the
# black temple's terrace on its east shoulder (12 m); the Mother's spring (7.5 m) with its dry basin; the pass between
# the peaks; the Green Mother's summit (60 m) and the trail up to it from the spring ----------------------------------------
brush flatten at -110 100 r=9 s=20 frames=150 h=-9
brush flatten at -35 -70 r=5 s=20 frames=120 h=16.5
brush flatten from -35 -71 to -35 -80 r=3.5 s=20 frames=80 h=16.3
for tz -40 -20 4
brush flatten from -6 $tz to 12 $tz r=4 s=20 frames=150 h=12
next
brush flatten at -3 42 r=6 s=20 frames=120 h=7.5
brush flatten at -3 42 r=2.2 s=20 frames=60 h=6.8
brush rock at -3 42 r=6 s=20 frames=20
brush flatten at 12 -12 r=6 s=20 frames=80 h=6.5
brush flatten at 30 40 r=7 s=20 frames=200 h=60
macro trail x1 z1 h1 x2 z2 h2 n
for i 0 $n 1
brush flatten at {$x1+($x2-$x1)*$i/$n} {$z1+($z2-$z1)*$i/$n} r=2.6 s=20 frames=40 h={$h1+($h2-$h1)*$i/$n}
next
end
call trail -3 42 8 10 60 16 8
call trail 10 60 16 35 70 28 10
call trail 35 70 28 50 50 40 10
call trail 50 50 40 40 30 50 9
call trail 40 30 50 22 32 56 8
call trail 22 32 56 30 40 60 5
clear from -3 42 to 10 60 r=3
clear from 10 60 to 35 70 r=3
clear from 35 70 to 50 50 r=3
clear from 50 50 to 40 30 r=3
clear from 40 30 to 22 32 r=3
clear at 30 40 r=8
clear from -82 95 to -38 95 r=17
clear at -35 -70 r=7
clear at 3 -30 r=12
clear at -3 42 r=7
clear at 12 -12 r=8

