# ===== CHAPTER 2 - THE THREE SHARDS =======================================================================================
# --- The lava tube in the Ember's south flank: Balboa's bear cave set into the slope, its mouth south onto the ledge, its
# gallery running into the mountain - the lava's glow and rumble inside, the ember beetles at the mouth, the chamber's
# chest, the ember pot with its live coal, a side cache -----------------------------------------------------------------
