prop motherbowl obj.name=motherbowl
prop motherbowl beh.use=Lay the three shards in the Mother's bowl
prop motherbowl if.use=quest|16\ntake|story:shard|3
prop motherbowl on.use=message||The shards slide together in the bowl as if they had never been apart. Light runs through the cracks and is gone - the Bloomstone, whole, green as a leaf. Around the basin, fireflies wake.\ngive||story:bloomstone*1\nshow|springglow\nshow|saddle\nsound||event:/crafting/learn
prop motherbowl else.use=message||A stone bowl with three hollows, worn smooth. The song carved on the stone beside it says what belongs in it - all three shards.
prop springglow obj.name=springglow
prop springglow beh.hidden=1
prop summitaltar obj.name=summitaltar
prop summitaltar beh.use=Lay the Bloomstone on the Mother's stone
prop summitaltar if.use=quest|20\ntake|story:bloomstone|1
prop summitaltar on.use=message||You lay the heart on the stone. For a breath, nothing. Then the ground sighs under your feet - and green runs down the mountain like water: grass over the ash, palms where the dead trees stood, flowers in the cracks. Across the saddle the Ember's fire sinks and goes out. On the stone, where the Bloomstone lay, there is a seed pod.\nhide|ash\nshow|green\nhide|ashsky\nshow|greensky\nhide|craterfire\nshow|canoes\nshow|welcomepost\nshow|homecoming\nsignal||bloomed\ngive||story:seedpod*1\nsound||event:/crafting/plant_plant
prop summitaltar else.use=message||The Mother's stone, bare and cold, a hollow on top the size of a heart.
