prop village zone.id=village
prop village zone.radius=14
prop village zone.message=The burnt village: huts on blackened posts, a great carved column, a canoe house with its doors hanging - and boars, grey with ash, rooting in the cold hearths.
prop wreckzone zone.id=wreck
prop wreckzone zone.radius=10
prop wreckzone zone.message=Corvan's ship on the floor of the bay, black with old fire, her hold's hatch jammed shut.
prop lavatubes zone.id=lavatubes
prop lavatubes zone.radius=10
prop lavatubes zone.message=The lava tubes: round black tunnels lit red from deep inside - and the clicking of beetles, big ones.
prop obsidiantemple zone.id=obsidiantemple
prop obsidiantemple zone.radius=10
prop obsidiantemple zone.message=The black temple: black pillars, three cold brazier stands and a door of grey stone.
prop motherspring zone.id=motherspring
prop motherspring zone.radius=8
prop motherspring zone.message=The Green Mother's spring: a dry basin, a stone bowl with three hollows, words carved on a stone.
prop saddle obj.name=saddle
prop saddle beh.hidden=1
prop saddle zone.id=saddle
prop saddle zone.radius=14
prop saddle zone.message=The saddle between the peaks. The Ember's mouth glows above you - and out of it comes the Cinderwraith, a bird of black stone with fire in its cracks!
prop mothersummit zone.id=mothersummit
prop mothersummit zone.radius=8
prop mothersummit zone.message=The top of the world: a ring of stones, the Mother's bare altar, and the whole grey island below.
prop homecoming zone.id=homecoming
prop homecoming zone.radius=12
prop homecoming zone.message=The village - green now, the canoes running up onto the sand, people jumping into the shallows. They are home.
