quest title=The Bloomstone
quest intro=An island of ash under two great peaks, a burnt village by the bay, and a story carved on a column. Start in the village.
# Chapter 1 - the ash shore
step reach|village|1|Land at the burnt village on the bay shore
step read|The elders' carving|1|Read the story carved round the village's great column
step kill|Warthog|3|Drive off the ash boars rooting through the village
step collect|story:prybar|1|Take the canoe builders' pry bar from the canoe house
step reach|wreck|1|Dive to the navigator's ship sunk in the bay
step read|Navigator's log|1|Read the navigator's log on the wreck's deck
# Chapter 2 - the three shards
step collect|story:shard|1|Pry open the wreck's hold for the first shard of the Bloomstone
step reach|lavatubes|1|Find the lava tubes in the Ember's south flank
step kill|Roach|4|Clear the ember beetles out of the tubes
step collect|story:shard|2|Take the second shard from the glowing chamber at the tubes' end
step collect|story:livecoal|1|Take a live coal from the ember pot by the lava glow
step reach|obsidiantemple|1|Climb to the black temple on the Ember's shoulder
step read|The temple's carving|1|Read the carving over the temple's braziers
step collect|story:shard|3|Light the braziers in the carving's order and take the third shard from the sanctum
# Chapter 3 - the mending
step reach|motherspring|1|Go to the Green Mother's spring at the foot of the eastern peak
step read|The Mother's song|1|Read the song carved by the dry basin
step collect|story:bloomstone|1|Lay the three shards in the Mother's bowl
step reach|saddle|1|Carry the Bloomstone up to the saddle between the peaks
step kill|Screecher|1|Face the Cinderwraith when it comes down off the Ember
step reach|mothersummit|1|Climb to the Green Mother's summit
# Chapter 4 - bloom
step collect|story:seedpod|1|Lay the Bloomstone on the Mother's stone - and watch the island turn green
step reach|homecoming|1|Go back down to the village - the canoes are coming home
step read|The elders' welcome|1|Read the elders' welcome on the new carved post
step open|Elders' gift|1|Open the elders' gift in the canoe house
quest done=The Mother is awake, the Ember asleep, and the island green from shore to summit. Its people are home - and so, it seems, are you.
quest reward=Plank*12;Rope*6;Cooked_Salmon*4

save Heart of Fire

